    {
      "source": "Returns <a href=\"#ORDER\">1950</a>, which ensures that the <code>BeanOverrideTestExecutionListener</code>\nis ordered after the\n<a href=\"../../support/DirtiesContextBeforeModesTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>DirtiesContextBeforeModesTestExecutionListener</code></a> and before the\n<a href=\"../../support/DependencyInjectionTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>DependencyInjectionTestExecutionListener</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回 <a href=\"#ORDER\">1950</a>，这确保 <code>BeanOverrideTestExecutionListener</code> 在 <a href=\"../../support/DirtiesContextBeforeModesTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>DirtiesContextBeforeModesTestExecutionListener</code></a> 之后且在 <a href=\"../../support/DependencyInjectionTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>DependencyInjectionTestExecutionListener</code></a> 之前执行。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Inject each <a href=\"BeanOverride.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context.bean.override\"><code>@BeanOverride</code></a> field in the\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">test instance</a> of the supplied <a href=\"../../TestContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.context\">test context</a> with a corresponding bean override instance.",
      "translation": "将每个 `<a href=\"BeanOverride.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context.bean.override\"><code>@BeanOverride</code></a>` 字段注入到提供的 `<a href=\"../../TestContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.context\">test context</a>` 的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">test instance</a>` 中，使用相应的 bean override 实例。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"#getOrder()\"><code>order</code></a> value for this listener: 1950.",
      "translation": "此监听器的<a href=\"#getOrder()\"><code>order</code></a>值为：1950。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "This method does nothing if the\n<a href=\"../../support/DependencyInjectionTestExecutionListener.html#REINJECT_DEPENDENCIES_ATTRIBUTE\"><code>REINJECT_DEPENDENCIES_ATTRIBUTE</code></a> attribute is not present in the\n<code>TestContext</code> with a value of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Boolean.html#TRUE\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Boolean.TRUE</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果 `<TestContext>` 中不存在值为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Boolean.html#TRUE\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Boolean.TRUE</code></a> 的 <code>REINJECT_DEPENDENCIES_ATTRIBUTE</code><a href=\"../../support/DependencyInjectionTestExecutionListener.html#REINJECT_DEPENDENCIES_ATTRIBUTE\"><code>REINJECT_DEPENDENCIES_ATTRIBUTE</code></a> 属性，则此方法不执行任何操作。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
